  "title": "Grandmother’s Oatmeal Coconut Cookies",
  "description": "Take a basic oatmeal cookie recipe and add crispy rice cereal and flaked coconut — it might be the best oatmeal cookie you’ve ever eaten!",
  "authors": [
    "JULES2JEWELS"
  ],
